### 8. Project Outcomes

The project demonstrates a working integration of an inventory application, centralized data storage, automated business workflows, AI-assisted analysis, and management reporting.

The implemented solution supports inventory transaction processing, stock validation, low-stock notifications, AI-generated forecasts, and operational visibility through a management dashboard.

The project uses simulated business data and is intended as a demonstration and portfolio solution rather than a production deployment for a live retailer.

